{"entryId":"3380","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:3380:1","sourceSha256":"d636a6e42cc974f849498735b37a1e9e5b3b9e89e3e104945a4624186308babf","englishSha256":"f14a061ccc751297717c41d9bc72d600173809d343be95587f35091524f1418c","citations":[{"id":"3380:1:link-015","he":[98,120],"en":[164,180],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_33b.6"},"reference":"Niddah 33b:6","assessment":"The checked Bavli locates Rav Shmuel at Tuakh and preserves Rav Pappa’s visit, question and exchange. The subject of “he left him and came” is Rav Shmuel in context. Shimi suggests the answer that the visitor subsequently could have given.","evidence":[{"reference":"Niddah 33b:6","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_33b.6"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Niddah 33b:7","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_33b.7"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Niddah 33b:9","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_33b.9"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Niddah 33b:11","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_33b.11"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Niddah 33b:12","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Niddah_33b.12"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0],"holds":[],"notes":[{"text":"The checked Bavli’s sequence indicates that Rav Shmuel went to Rav Shimi and received the suggested reply. Heilprin explicitly makes Rav Pappa the subject of the visit.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
